-- Reviewed univalence and categorical comparison (2026-10-29).
-- Informal proofs: source headers and unit/doc/functorial-schemes.tex §8.
-- SipGeneric and category interfaces are reused through local symlinks.
-- Each list records the constructions and record presentations used by
-- that declaration's proof, including the explicit record retractions.
-- No comparison may open additional definitions outside these lists.
